Third-party components
----------------------

This program bundles the following open-source components:

  CustomTkinter  - MIT License        - https://github.com/TomSchimansky/CustomTkinter
  requests       - Apache License 2.0 - https://github.com/psf/requests
  spylls         - MIT License        - https://github.com/zverok/spylls
  Python         - PSF License        - https://www.python.org

Spelling dictionaries are NOT bundled with this program. They are downloaded
on demand from the LibreOffice dictionary repository and remain under their own
licences (LGPL / MPL / CC-BY-SA depending on the language). See
https://github.com/LibreOffice/dictionaries for details.
